  m_text: 'Ultimate:

    Catch fish to fill up your ultimate bar. When the bar is
    full click it for a powerful ability!


    Pufferfish:

    The pufferfish immediately
    collects your fish in a small area.



    Electric Eel:

    The eel swims to
    your opponents side and stuns them for a moment.


    Angler Fish:

    The
    Angler fish lights up an area of your pond, increasing your points per fish caught.'
