  m_text: "\nSomething about Buffs: \n\nPufferfish: Explodes the area around it and
    collects all fish puddles at ones in the radius\n\r\nAngler fish: Lights a area,
    all fish puddles in that area are 2/3x more points worth\n\r\nUltimate: 4/5x
    more fish puddles on your side | 3x more chance on ability fish"
